														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1433291">
									

<p>I haven't written anything in a while, so I decided to write this up and post it. As I said in the first edit, I have to go to work, but I'll do a second look when I get home. Pretty sure I didn't miss any spelling errors, but if I did, feel free to correct them. You know, if doing something I'm supposed to do is your thing.</p>
<p>The story behind it is a bit interesting. I'm about 90% sure that this story has been written before. The entire plot of this story has been in my head for a few weeks, but I've held off writing it because I can't help but think it's been done. Thing is, <em>I can't find any proof of that</em>. I've googled the hell out of it, but I've found nothing that leads me to think it's been done. So in order to get the story out of my head, I decided to write it down and post it here.</p>

							</div>

								
					
