			<div class="content" id="post-content-1433890">
									

<p>Well, that solves a mystery (only right now did I get the twin meaning of the story title!) I've had in my head for weeks. I've surprised myself on how much of the detail in the original story I remembered.</p>
<p>I'll open this up to others: what should I do about this story? People seem to like it, and I'm proud of how the story came out, but I'm kinda embarrassed that I went from &quot;Story I Think I Might Have Heard, But I'm Writing It Down To Get It Out Of My Head&quot; to &quot;Holy Shit I Copied Someone's Story&quot;.</p>

